is a well-designed sandwich case with good airflow and ample space for component installation. It accommodates a 70mm CPU cooler, up to 120mm x 25mm top exhaust fan, 80mm low intake fan, and SFX PSU. The case fits 2-slot GPUs up to 180mm in length, making it compatible with most single-fan ITX cards. The leather top handle is quality but requires basic leather care. This build features white components with RGB accents for a bright aesthetic. Cable management is straightforward thanks to the spacious interior. The i5-13600K paired with the RTX 4070 ITX provides solid performance. CPU temperatures reach the Tjunction limit of 100C at 215W under stress, but with P1 set to 150W, temperatures are a more reasonable 80-85C. The 850W PSU provides good overhead for future upgrades. The Zephyr RTX 4070 is the only single-fan variant at this power level, running at PCIe x16 with GDDR6x memory and a 192-bit interface. Performance in stress testing and general use is solid with effective heat exhaustion via the top 120mm fan. The case offers solid aluminum construction and is portable enough for a backpack-friendly portable system. Note: The case does not include a PCIe riser cable; an 18.5cm Gen 4 double reverse riser was purchased separately from AliExpress. Do not exceed 18.5cm riser length to avoid interference with the exhaust fan.17:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\",\"children\":\"Builder notes\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\",\"children\":\"$20\"}]]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Performance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\"